abstract: >
  Manuscript source, closed-world detector study, independent plane-local
  baseline, canonical results, and a repeated bounded Kubernetes/GitOps
  laboratory measuring divergence between operational reality and the basis
  under which infrastructure was approved, with compound-vector observations,
  temporal evidence contracts, and an extended benign soak.
